    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d338">

                <pb facs="0351" n="327" sameAs="frus:frus1864p4/pg327"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Marsh.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 96.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1864-04-19"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 19, 1864</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Your despatch, No. 87, of the 21st ultimo,
                    marked <hi rendition="#italic">confidential,</hi> has been received, and I thank
                    you for the very interesting summary which it presents of the prominent
                    political questions which now engage the attention of European statesmen.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">George P. Marsh</hi>, Esq., &amp;<hi
                            rendition="#italic">c</hi>., &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.,
                            &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.<hi rendition="#italic">,
                            Turin.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
